WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.160 --> 01:02.982
Nat, watch out!

3
01:06.280 --> 01:10.200
It means the cycle will turn, bringing back your karma.

4
01:10.200 --> 01:12.680
You reap what you sow.

5
01:12.680 --> 01:14.320
They're evil.

6
01:14.320 --> 01:16.564
You need to know the whole truth.

7
01:23.240 --> 01:24.600
But I saw it.

8
01:24.600 --> 01:25.680
Saw what?

9
01:25.680 --> 01:29.371
The three of you in the past. You hurt people, and they want revenge.

10
01:38.160 --> 01:39.320
Yo!

11
01:39.320 --> 01:41.840
You must die!

12
01:46.920 --> 01:48.445
Yo...

13
01:50.480 --> 01:52.680
- Yo! - Nat!

14
01:52.680 --> 01:54.488
What's wrong with you, Yo?

15
01:55.266 --> 01:57.093
Stop causing trouble.

16
01:57.093 --> 01:58.718
I don't care who you date.

17
01:58.718 --> 02:01.280
But you have to accept my story too.

18
02:01.280 --> 02:03.400
And if you say you were possessed,

19
02:03.400 --> 02:06.360
then you must believe Whan and I were possessed too.

20
02:06.360 --> 02:10.160
Nat, don't go. Listen to me.

21
02:10.160 --> 02:12.120
I'm worried about you.

22
02:12.120 --> 02:13.835
Nat!

23
02:37.600 --> 02:39.080
I didn't possess them!

24
02:39.080 --> 02:40.200
They're evil!

25
02:40.200 --> 02:43.080
Do you hear me? They're evil!

26
02:43.080 --> 02:44.440
I'll get back at them!

27
02:44.440 --> 02:45.640
I didn't possess them!

28
02:45.640 --> 02:47.906
They're evil!

29
02:47.906 --> 02:50.360
- I didn't possess them! - They're evil!

30
02:50.360 --> 02:51.895
I'll get back at them!

31
02:51.895 --> 02:53.200
I didn't possess them!

32
02:53.200 --> 02:54.560
I'll get back at them!

33
02:54.560 --> 02:55.980
They're evil!

34
02:55.980 --> 02:57.400
I'll get back at them!

35
02:57.400 --> 02:58.680
I didn't possess them!

36
02:58.680 --> 03:00.711
They're evil!

37
03:14.813 --> 03:16.000
Hey...

38
03:16.000 --> 03:17.720
Yo!

39
03:17.720 --> 03:19.400
Hey!

40
03:19.400 --> 03:22.120
You want me to find a new place

41
03:22.120 --> 03:25.040
so it'll be easier for us to meet, right?

42
03:25.040 --> 03:26.673
What do you think?

43
03:27.400 --> 03:30.958
Okay. After breakfast, I'll ask Yo if I can go look at a place.

44
03:33.600 --> 03:36.391
Hey, Yo.

45
04:07.240 --> 04:09.273
You're dead!

46
04:56.360 --> 05:01.217
The three of you in the past. You hurt people, and they want revenge.

47
05:06.200 --> 05:07.876
Yo.

48
05:46.240 --> 05:47.720
Yo.

49
05:47.720 --> 05:49.600
Yo.

50
05:49.600 --> 05:51.314
Yo.

51
06:01.520 --> 06:03.179
I'm not Yo.

52
06:03.179 --> 06:06.080
Yo, focus! Don't let it possess you!

53
06:06.080 --> 06:07.832
You can't control me.

54
06:18.720 --> 06:21.558
You want to know the truth, don't you?

55
06:21.558 --> 06:24.455
I'll show you what really happened.

56
06:41.886 --> 06:44.080
Bring Sali to me.

57
06:44.080 --> 06:45.460
Yes, sir.

58
07:04.040 --> 07:08.220
Please stop, Master Lert.

59
07:10.520 --> 07:12.367
Sali... Sali...

60
07:53.880 --> 07:55.320
I'll lead them the other way.

61
07:55.320 --> 07:57.600
Meet me at the abandoned temple south of here.

62
07:57.600 --> 08:02.676
No! I told you. If we die, we die together.

63
08:03.560 --> 08:06.664
Don't worry about me. I can take care of myself.

64
08:07.880 --> 08:11.160
Pan, get Sali out of here. Hurry!

65
08:11.160 --> 08:14.245
Yohd, you have to be okay.

66
08:17.480 --> 08:19.720
I'll be fine.

67
08:19.720 --> 08:21.565
Go. Hurry.

68
08:36.080 --> 08:37.600
They dared to run away.

69
08:37.600 --> 08:40.160
Find them and bring them back!

70
08:40.160 --> 08:42.563
Or Master Lert will kill you all.

71
08:48.240 --> 08:50.640
You lot, that way! Go!

72
08:53.880 --> 08:56.513
Yohd! Go!

73
09:12.520 --> 09:13.673
Stop!

74
09:15.520 --> 09:16.579
Yohd!

75
09:30.040 --> 09:32.049
Yohd, you're dead!

76
09:39.960 --> 09:43.193
Pan, let's go back to help Yohd.

77
09:44.920 --> 09:46.286
Please...

78
09:49.720 --> 09:53.986
Sali... Sali!

79
09:58.279 --> 10:02.594
Are you going to tell me where Pan and Sali are?

80
10:07.120 --> 10:08.626
Whip her harder!

81
10:14.840 --> 10:16.782
Throw salt water on her.

82
10:32.160 --> 10:34.036
Are you going to tell me now?

83
10:40.240 --> 10:41.486
This is what you get

84
10:42.240 --> 10:44.049
for keeping your mouth shut, Yohd.

85
11:24.800 --> 11:26.285
Yohd!

86
11:30.240 --> 11:33.200
Lady Bulan, please stop.

87
11:33.200 --> 11:35.628
We won't try to run away again.

88
11:52.600 --> 11:56.731
Take him to my room. Pry out his fingernails until he wakes.

89
11:56.731 --> 11:58.000
Yes, sir.

90
12:00.480 --> 12:01.994
Pan!

91
12:10.453 --> 12:15.297
Lady Bulan, please have mercy. Please let us go.

92
12:24.000 --> 12:25.685
Yohd...

93
12:26.315 --> 12:28.200
Yohd...

94
12:28.200 --> 12:30.161
Yohd...

95
12:33.760 --> 12:36.800
Take care of my parents for me.

96
12:41.840 --> 12:43.573
Yohd!

97
12:47.080 --> 12:49.260
You want to die like Yohd?

98
12:56.960 --> 12:58.702
No, you die!

99
13:49.680 --> 13:50.920
You're a slave.

100
13:50.920 --> 13:54.224
You think you can escape your master that easily?

101
14:02.800 --> 14:05.760
Go on. Go save your wife.

102
14:05.760 --> 14:07.760
I'm letting you go.

103
15:00.215 --> 15:01.633
I let you go.

104
15:01.633 --> 15:03.961
I never said you'd survive.

105
15:14.560 --> 15:16.283
Whip her!

106
15:55.840 --> 15:57.992
I love seeing people in love.

107
15:58.600 --> 16:04.289
Love makes fools do foolish things.

108
16:07.720 --> 16:10.015
Do you want your husband to live?

109
16:15.480 --> 16:19.308
Then trade your hand for his life.

110
16:27.560 --> 16:30.150
No... Please, no.

111
16:39.240 --> 16:41.249
It's not an order.

112
16:42.120 --> 16:44.182
It's a choice.

113
16:49.440 --> 16:52.773
No... Sali.

114
17:04.320 --> 17:06.272
No, Sali!

115
17:27.560 --> 17:29.179
Sali!

116
17:34.040 --> 17:36.944
Sali!

117
17:56.240 --> 17:57.744
Sali...

118
18:20.400 --> 18:23.833
Pan... Pan!

119
18:31.800 --> 18:35.571
Look what your love has brought you.

120
18:35.571 --> 18:37.826
In the end, you hurt each other.

121
18:43.600 --> 18:48.647
I'll haunt you in every lifetime.

122
18:55.400 --> 18:57.485
You talk too much, don't you?

123
19:58.480 --> 20:02.318
I'll haunt you in every lifetime.

124
20:07.160 --> 20:08.531
Pam.

125
20:09.720 --> 20:11.169
Pam.

126
20:20.120 --> 20:24.262
Pam, this isn't funny. Come up now.

127
20:28.040 --> 20:32.344
Nat... she swore she'd haunt me in every lifetime.

128
20:32.935 --> 20:35.400
You just fell asleep and slipped under the water.

129
20:35.400 --> 20:37.675
There's no one here.

130
20:45.280 --> 20:46.860
Here.

131
20:58.680 --> 21:00.527
It's in the mirror.

132
21:03.000 --> 21:07.338
All I see is you and your paranoia.

133
21:10.159 --> 21:12.011
There's nothing there.

134
21:38.720 --> 21:42.080
Bind their souls. Never let them be reborn.

135
21:42.080 --> 21:44.718
Throw their bodies to the vultures.

136
21:49.280 --> 21:51.299
I'll get back at all of you.

137
21:57.160 --> 21:59.274
I'll get back at you.

138
22:00.400 --> 22:02.704
I'll get back at all of you.

139
22:04.960 --> 22:07.179
I'll get back at all of you.

140
22:16.000 --> 22:17.409
Yo.

141
22:19.363 --> 22:22.140
- Yo. - I'll get back at you.

142
22:22.140 --> 22:23.920
I'll get back at all of you.

143
22:23.920 --> 22:30.360
I'll get back at all of you.

144
22:30.360 --> 22:33.093
I'll get back at all of you.

145
22:39.200 --> 22:41.514
I'll get back at you.

146
22:43.080 --> 22:44.680
Yo.

147
22:44.680 --> 22:46.213
Yo.

148
23:03.680 --> 23:07.575
I saw what they did to them.

149
23:10.640 --> 23:12.763
I feel so sorry for them.

150
23:14.200 --> 23:15.960
You have to stay strong, Yo.

151
23:15.960 --> 23:17.960
Don't let them take over.

152
23:52.760 --> 23:54.575
From what you've told me,

153
23:54.575 --> 23:59.379
they're using you to get revenge because your will isn't strong.

154
24:00.280 --> 24:02.318
I saw the three of them.

155
24:03.920 --> 24:06.005
They were tortured to death.

156
24:08.120 --> 24:10.185
How could anyone be so cruel?

157
24:10.185 --> 24:15.068
Back then, masters had the power of life and death.

158
24:15.068 --> 24:17.400
But what they resent even more is...

159
24:17.400 --> 24:22.500
that their trapped souls can never be reborn.

160
24:24.480 --> 24:26.287
Is there any way to fix this?

161
24:27.920 --> 24:29.201
Yes.

162
24:30.600 --> 24:32.314
The three from the past,

163
24:33.080 --> 24:38.041
Lert, Bulan, and Sroi must die.

164
24:44.040 --> 24:50.000
That means your husband, Pam, and Whan...

165
24:50.000 --> 24:51.578
They must die.

166
24:53.680 --> 24:56.689
Is there any way to save them?

167
25:13.280 --> 25:14.841
What's wrong?

168
25:17.840 --> 25:19.297
Yo's coming over.

169
25:29.760 --> 25:31.588
Nat, you have to become a monk.

170
25:32.360 --> 25:35.080
Over some crazy dream of yours?

171
25:35.080 --> 25:36.800
I saw it with my own eyes, Nat.

172
25:36.800 --> 25:41.428
With your own eyes? Come on, Yo. How?

173
25:45.720 --> 25:49.624
I know you don't believe me, but I'm serious, Nat.

174
25:51.000 --> 25:52.523
Please become a monk, Nat.

175
25:53.280 --> 25:58.120
So you can make merit for those you've wronged in the past.

176
25:58.120 --> 25:59.520
Please, Nat.

177
25:59.520 --> 26:01.680
I'm serious too, Yo.

178
26:01.680 --> 26:03.600
I'm not becoming a monk.

179
26:03.600 --> 26:04.899
Nat...

180
26:05.720 --> 26:07.462
Let's not fight right now.

181
26:08.946 --> 26:10.824
I know you mean well.

182
26:11.400 --> 26:15.076
Thank you. I'll talk to Nat about it.

183
26:33.040 --> 26:34.667
What do you mean?

184
26:34.667 --> 26:37.249
I think Yo is genuinely worried about us.

185
26:38.579 --> 26:41.321
And maybe she really did see something.

186
26:55.720 --> 26:59.853
I think I saw something too.

187
27:05.920 --> 27:07.600
Last night, when I was leaving,

188
27:07.600 --> 27:11.198
I'm sure I walked into the elevator alone.

189
27:11.198 --> 27:12.680
But while I was in there,

190
27:12.680 --> 27:16.993
I felt like someone was watching me.

191
27:19.560 --> 27:23.813
When I got out, I turned around to look again.

192
27:23.813 --> 27:26.923
There were three people standing in the elevator.

193
27:28.866 --> 27:31.035
They looked terrifying.

194
27:31.035 --> 27:33.995
Were you drunk? We did drink quite a lot.

195
27:38.680 --> 27:40.660
You should listen to Yo, Nat.

196
27:44.360 --> 27:46.388
The day I sank into the bathtub,

197
27:47.480 --> 27:51.022
I really felt someone pulling me under.

198
27:52.000 --> 27:53.120
Pam...

199
27:53.120 --> 27:58.600
I know we'd been drinking, but I wasn't drunk or dreaming.

200
27:58.600 --> 28:01.360
And I wasn't obsessing over what that fortune teller said.

201
28:01.360 --> 28:03.643
But I really saw a ghost.

202
28:05.600 --> 28:07.280
The ghost of someone we once hurt.

203
28:07.280 --> 28:09.000
We've never hurt anyone.

204
28:09.000 --> 28:10.720
Not in this lifetime, Nat.

205
28:10.720 --> 28:13.558
I've never hurt anyone in any lifetime.

206
28:17.200 --> 28:18.752
Then look at this.

207
28:30.880 --> 28:33.184
A ghost strangled me, Nat.

208
28:34.026 --> 28:35.537
I'm scared.

209
28:37.680 --> 28:40.440
Don't be scared. Trust me.

210
28:40.440 --> 28:42.240
Ghosts aren't real.

211
28:55.320 --> 28:57.453
I want to talk to you about Yo.

212
29:00.320 --> 29:02.702
I knew this was about Yo.

213
29:02.702 --> 29:06.720
Since we broke up, you've never wanted to see me again.

214
29:06.720 --> 29:09.053
We're over. Why would I?

215
29:11.520 --> 29:16.833
So why did you ask me here to talk about Yo?

216
29:16.833 --> 29:21.520
I saw the clip of you and Nat talking about finding a new place.

217
29:21.520 --> 29:23.990
You want me to find a new place

218
29:23.990 --> 29:27.441
so it'll be easier for us to see each other, right?

219
29:28.880 --> 29:31.200
You two were already having an affair.

220
29:31.200 --> 29:33.000
It wasn't because you were possessed.

221
29:33.880 --> 29:36.133
And now the ghosts are angry.

222
29:36.920 --> 29:40.400
Do I have to believe that ghosts are real?

223
29:40.400 --> 29:42.066
That's up to you.

224
29:43.600 --> 29:46.020
But I really want you to change.

225
29:46.020 --> 29:47.920
Yo hasn't seen the clip yet.

226
29:47.920 --> 29:49.576
You still have time to change.

227
29:49.576 --> 29:52.400
It's too late, Pete.

228
29:52.400 --> 29:56.200
Because now Nat, Pam, and I

229
29:56.200 --> 29:58.720
are happy being together like this.

230
29:58.720 --> 30:00.440
Do whatever you want with that clip.

231
30:00.440 --> 30:02.377
I don't care.

232
30:15.080 --> 30:17.840
You want me to find a new place

233
30:17.840 --> 30:20.840
so it'll be easier for us to see each other, right?

234
30:20.840 --> 30:22.920
What do you think?

235
30:22.920 --> 30:25.240
After breakfast, I'll ask...

236
30:27.160 --> 30:29.645
The day I found you unconscious here,

237
30:30.660 --> 30:33.491
this clip suddenly popped up on your phone.

238
30:33.491 --> 30:36.840
I think they wanted you to see it.

239
30:36.840 --> 30:38.970
I really don't feel anything anymore.

240
30:40.760 --> 30:46.140
Now I know for sure those two were having an affair.

241
30:46.920 --> 30:50.239
It wasn't possession, like they tried to tell me.

242
30:51.080 --> 30:53.230
I don't want you involved with them anymore.

243
31:02.120 --> 31:03.605
I'm worried about you.

244
31:06.240 --> 31:08.801
The spirits are trying to take control of you.

245
31:09.520 --> 31:12.043
And your relationship is toxic.

246
31:16.800 --> 31:18.809
I've given up on it too.

247
31:21.679 --> 31:23.232
I think...

248
31:24.400 --> 31:26.651
I'll move back to my own house.

249
31:27.440 --> 31:30.740
If you need anything, just let me know.

250
31:32.040 --> 31:33.350
Thank you.

251
31:39.160 --> 31:40.720
I'm not letting you go anywhere.

252
31:40.720 --> 31:43.712
Have you forgotten that your house in Bangkok is being repossessed?

253
31:45.600 --> 31:48.990
But I can't live like this with three or four of us, Nat.

254
31:51.480 --> 31:55.077
Don't you believe they're waiting for you?

255
31:56.493 --> 31:58.430
I know you mean well, Yo,

256
31:59.308 --> 32:01.339
but I don't want to become a monk.

257
32:02.720 --> 32:05.120
What if the ghosts come for you?

258
32:05.120 --> 32:07.240
If ghosts are stronger than people,

259
32:07.240 --> 32:08.896
then let them prove it.

260
32:16.800 --> 32:18.733
Coward!

261
32:22.120 --> 32:23.960
Weak!

262
32:23.960 --> 32:25.520
Stupid!

263
32:25.520 --> 32:26.880
Where are you going?

264
32:26.880 --> 32:31.000
Does he love you, or is he playing you for a fool?

265
32:31.000 --> 32:35.560
Kadkao... Kadkao...

266
32:35.560 --> 32:41.080
Kadkao... Kadkao...

267
32:41.080 --> 32:42.319
Kadkao!

268
32:42.319 --> 32:43.520
I'm not Kadkao!

269
32:43.520 --> 32:47.177
Look what he's done to you.

270
32:55.870 --> 32:57.200
Kadkao!

271
32:57.200 --> 33:00.691
I'm not Kadkao!

272
33:00.691 --> 33:03.960
Kadkao...

273
33:03.960 --> 33:07.974
Kadkao...

274
33:23.400 --> 33:28.133
Yo... Yo, what's wrong?

275
33:28.920 --> 33:31.658
Yo... Yo!

276
33:34.080 --> 33:37.803
Come out if you dare! I'm not afraid of you!

277
33:39.840 --> 33:42.510
Yo... Yo!

278
33:57.840 --> 34:00.360
Leave those who aren't involved alone.

279
34:00.360 --> 34:01.400
Piss off!

280
34:01.400 --> 34:03.361
This is none of your business!

281
34:04.400 --> 34:07.760
You three are so consumed by hatred,

282
34:07.760 --> 34:11.382
you've forgotten who I am.

283
34:12.640 --> 34:15.400
I'll speak to Master Lert myself.

284
34:15.400 --> 34:16.760
Thank you, Uncle.

285
34:16.760 --> 34:20.560
Master Lert, please. Have mercy on Pan. Sali is pregnant.

286
34:20.560 --> 34:21.760
You dare defy my order?

287
34:21.760 --> 34:26.083
No, sir. I'd even give my life for you, Master Lert.

288
34:27.600 --> 34:31.840
If I hadn't helped you, I wouldn't have died.

289
34:31.840 --> 34:35.640
You three must let go of your hatred and vengeance.

290
34:35.640 --> 34:38.360
No! They cursed us so we could never be reborn!

291
34:38.360 --> 34:39.560
Lert must die!

292
34:39.560 --> 34:42.600
They must die and take our place!

293
34:42.600 --> 34:45.840
Then leave Yo alone. She has nothing to do with this.

294
34:45.840 --> 34:48.925
You think Kadkao isn't involved?

295
34:49.640 --> 34:54.687
I'll make Kadkao remember she's no different from us.

296
35:15.167 --> 35:16.693
Yo...

297
35:29.080 --> 35:30.880
How are you feeling?

298
35:33.120 --> 35:35.053
Here. Let me help you.

299
35:40.687 --> 35:42.813
Have some water.

300
35:55.440 --> 35:57.516
I'm suffering, Nat.

301
35:58.400 --> 36:01.409
Why is all this happening to me?

302
36:02.600 --> 36:05.961
I won't let my life repeat the same cycle again.

303
36:07.560 --> 36:08.721
Nat...

304
36:15.360 --> 36:17.151
Please divorce me.

305
36:20.120 --> 36:21.243
No.

306
36:22.720 --> 36:24.348
Please...

307
36:25.640 --> 36:27.902
let me go, Nat. Set me free.

308
36:30.960 --> 36:32.960
I love you, Yo.

309
36:34.280 --> 36:36.375
And I'm not afraid of any damn ghost.

310
36:40.240 --> 36:42.281
But if you want me to become a monk,

311
36:43.000 --> 36:45.080
I'll do it,

312
36:45.080 --> 36:46.805
if it'll give you peace of mind.

313
36:48.533 --> 36:49.996
Really, Nat?

314
37:11.640 --> 37:13.760
I don't want your merit!

315
37:13.760 --> 37:14.920
You have to die!

316
37:14.920 --> 37:16.520
You have to break the curse.

317
37:16.520 --> 37:19.500
Damn you! I don't want your merit!

318
37:21.880 --> 37:23.773
My source told me

319
37:23.773 --> 37:26.127
things have been strange at this house lately.

320
37:27.960 --> 37:30.280
Sometimes there are loud noises,

321
37:30.280 --> 37:32.930
like someone's dragging something around upstairs.

322
37:33.703 --> 37:37.351
Sometimes people hear a woman or a man crying.

323
37:40.800 --> 37:44.009
Think we'll find something like we did in those other cases?

324
37:51.200 --> 37:54.609
If they want our help, I think we will.

325
38:05.320 --> 38:08.140
Sorry, Inspector. The power's out for a moment.

326
38:08.140 --> 38:10.386
The transformer outside the station blew.

327
38:17.840 --> 38:21.763
Damn, you scared me. I thought we'd seen a ghost.

328
38:33.080 --> 38:34.775
Hey!

329
38:38.080 --> 38:39.280
How can I help you?

330
38:39.280 --> 38:41.318
Please help Kadkao.

331
38:42.720 --> 38:46.560
Sure. You can tell the duty officer what happened.

332
38:46.560 --> 38:48.293
This way, please.

333
38:51.960 --> 38:53.996
- Hey! - Where are you going?

334
38:53.996 --> 38:56.240
Taking someone to file a report.

335
38:56.240 --> 38:57.297
What?

336
38:59.760 --> 39:01.240
Where?

337
39:01.240 --> 39:02.839
Right here.

338
39:06.380 --> 39:08.200
They were just here.

339
39:12.160 --> 39:13.864
Where are they?

340
39:24.400 --> 39:26.019
- Good morning, Inspector. - Morning.

341
39:45.000 --> 39:46.480
Hello, Yo.

342
39:46.480 --> 39:48.127
Can we talk later?

343
39:48.127 --> 39:51.120
It's not a good time right now.

344
39:51.120 --> 39:53.360
Okay.

345
39:53.360 --> 39:55.491
I'll come by this evening. Will you be free?

346
39:57.213 --> 39:58.616
Sure.

347
40:04.200 --> 40:06.123
Keep it somewhere safe, Yo.

348
40:06.933 --> 40:09.527
This house is yours now.

349
40:09.527 --> 40:11.148
So you can finally feel at ease.

350
40:13.400 --> 40:16.674
What about selling it to Pam?

351
40:16.674 --> 40:19.927
Don't worry about that. I'll sort it out with her.

352
40:21.720 --> 40:25.483
I want you to have peace of mind, so you'll stop thinking about divorce.

353
40:32.093 --> 40:33.639
I love you, Yo.

354
40:37.320 --> 40:39.005
I love you too.

355
40:41.280 --> 40:42.500
I love you so much.

356
40:44.160 --> 40:45.864
Don't overthink it anymore.

357
40:46.599 --> 40:48.311
I'd better get to work now.

358
40:50.200 --> 40:51.809
Okay.

359
41:11.720 --> 41:15.739
[Land Title Deed]

360
41:37.048 --> 41:39.200
[Memorandum of Registration]

361
41:39.200 --> 41:41.480
[Gift: Triwit Thanahirankit to Nat Thanahirankit]

362
41:41.480 --> 41:43.775
[Gift: Nat Thanahirankit to Yotaka Thanahirankit]

363
42:06.320 --> 42:10.000
I may have my doubts,

364
42:10.000 --> 42:11.520
but I don't want to know anymore.

365
42:11.520 --> 42:13.819
Bitch Bulan killed you!

366
42:14.720 --> 42:18.441
A fool like you is bound to be betrayed.

367
42:18.441 --> 42:22.346
You'll be betrayed until you die, Kadkao!

368
42:22.346 --> 42:28.880
- I'm not Kadkao! - Kadkao... Kadkao...

369
42:28.880 --> 42:31.960
I'm not Kadkao!

370
42:31.960 --> 42:33.302
Yo!

371
43:01.080 --> 43:04.058
I have no idea how it video-called you.

372
43:04.058 --> 43:05.400
I absolutely refuse to divorce.

373
43:05.400 --> 43:06.680
But I'm getting a divorce.

374
43:06.680 --> 43:09.080
You think I'll let you go that easily, Nat?

375
43:09.080 --> 43:11.000
You'll never get away from me.

376
43:11.000 --> 43:13.840
It's like our ancestors were trying to tell us

377
43:13.840 --> 43:16.612
that their souls are trapped.

378
43:21.120 --> 43:23.398
We've waited so long for you.

379
43:23.398 --> 43:25.360
Go see it for yourself.

380
43:25.360 --> 43:28.680
Send her to the kitchen. Make her chop wood and carry water.

381
43:28.680 --> 43:31.279
Don't let her come up here.
